<div class="js-cont-wrap cont">
    <div class="cont01 js-cont">
        <p><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont01_img.jpg" alt="" /></p>
    </div>
    <div class="cont02 js-cont">
        <p><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_tit.jpg" alt=""></p>
        <div class="inner">
            <div class="box">
                <p><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_img01.jpg" alt="" /></p>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="infra-wrap">
                    <div class="infra-slide swiper-container">
                        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_slide01.png" alt="" /></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_slide02.png" alt="" /></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_slide03.png" alt="" /></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_slide04.png" alt="" /></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_slide05.png" alt="" /></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_slide06.png" alt="" /></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-pagination infra"></div>
                    </div>
                    <p><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_txt.png" alt="" /></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="txt">러셀의 검증된 시스템</p>
            <div class="box">
                <p><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_img02.jpg" alt="" /></p>
            </div>
            <div class="d-start box">
                <div class="doughnut">
                    <p><strong>재수생 우선선발반 재원생<br>
                        <span>10명 중 9명</span> 수능 성적 향상</strong><br>
                        <span>*HS반, 서의치반, 연고대반 재원생 기준</span>
                    </p>
                    <div class="chart-area">
                        <canvas id="doughnut-chart"></canvas>
                        <div class="chart-img"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_chart01.png" alt="" /></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bar-graph">
                    <p>
                        <strong>2022 vs 2023 수능<br>
                        백분위 성적 향상 점수</strong><br>
                        <span>*HS반, 서의치반, 연고대반 재원생 기준</span>
                    </p>
                    <div class="graph-con">
                        <span class="bar-img"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_img03.png" alt="" /></span>
                        <span class="bubble"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/graph_balloon.png" alt="" /></span>
                        <span class="arrow"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/graph_arrow.png" alt="" /></span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="l-txt">* 2023년 러셀학원 내 HS반,연고대반 재원생들의<br>
                       메가X대성 더 프리미엄 모의고사 국수영탐2 평균성적 비교</p>
                </div>
                <div><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont02_txt02.png" alt=""></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cont03 js-cont">
        <p><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont03_tit.jpg" alt=""></p>
        <p><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/russel_hs/event/2024/cont03_img.jpg" alt=""></p>
    </div>
</div>